@startuml 01-coordination-event-and-actor-sequence
' 图 01 时序：协调生命周期（消息交换）
' 对应类图 01-coordination-event-and-actor.puml
' 贯穿案例：「请调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式并撰写一份详细的调研报告」

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 72
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title 图 01 时序：协调生命周期（消息交换）\n案例：Alice 请调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式并撰写详细调研报告

mainframe Actor 不 emit Event；Event 无 payload；任务正文在 WorkArtifact.contentRef

hide footbox
autonumber 1 1 "<b>"

box "边界" #FFFFFF
  actor "Human\nhuman-alice" as Alice #FFF3E0
  boundary "ExternalInput" as Ext #FFFFFF
end box

box "编排运行时" #E8F4FD
  control "Runtime\nAdmission" as RT #E8F4FD
  database "CollaborationStore\nSnapshot + auditTail" as Store #E8F4FD
  database "ChangeLog" as Log #FFF8E8
end box

box "执行体" #FFF3E0
  participant "agent-planner\nAgent" as Planner #FFF3E0
  participant "agent-researcher\nAgent" as Researcher #FFF3E0
  participant "tool-web-search\nTool" as Tool #FFF3E0
end box

== T0 · 会话就绪 ==

note over Store
  **snap-002** · epoch-research-v1
  participants: alice, planner, researcher, web-search
  artifacts · ∅  ·  auditTail · ∅
end note

== ① 外部信号落账（尚无 Event） ==

Alice -> Ext : 用户消息\n「请调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式\n并撰写详细调研报告」
Ext -> RT : 外部信号到达
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> Store : 追加 **ObservationEntry#1**
note right of Store
  seq=1 · source=human-alice
  payloadRef=ref:msg-001
  receivedAt=2026-08-06T13:00:00
  --
  auditTail ← [Obs#1]
  **图结构未变**
end note
Store --> RT : ok

== ② Event#1 · introduce_artifact ==

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 introduce_artifact\nexternal=ref:audit#1
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-001-introduce**
note right of Log
  operation=introduce_artifact
  initiator=agent-planner
  beforeRef=snap-002 → afterRef=snap-003
  targets.primary=task-T-ontology-report
  **无 payload**
end note
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-003**
note right of Store
  + WorkArtifact task-T-ontology-report
  contentRef=ref:task-body
  owner=agent-planner
end note
Store --> RT : ok

RT --> Planner : 通知：任务已创建
deactivate RT

== ③ Event#2 · delegate ==

Planner -> RT : 协调意图：委派 task-T
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 delegate\ninitiator=agent-planner
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-002-delegate**
note right of Log
  involved=[agent-researcher]
  secondary=[session-planner-researcher,
             write-lock-doc-draft]
end note
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-004**
note right of Store
  task-T.owner → agent-researcher
  + session-planner-researcher
  + write-lock-doc-draft
  + link: delegated-to researcher
end note
Store --> RT : ok

RT --> Researcher : 通知：收到委派
RT --> Planner : 通知：委派完成
deactivate RT

== ④ Event#3 · accept ==

Researcher -> RT : 协调意图：接受 task-T
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 accept\ninitiator=agent-researcher
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-003-accept**
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-005**
note right of Store
  planner.status=waiting
  researcher.status=active
end note
Store --> RT : ok
deactivate RT

== ⑤ Event#4 · invoke_tool ==

Researcher -> RT : 协调意图：调用 web-search
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 invoke_tool\ninitiator=agent-researcher
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-004-invoke-tool**
note right of Log
  involved=[tool-web-search]
  targets.primary=tool-web-search
end note
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-006**
Store --> RT : ok

RT -> Tool : 派发检索请求\n「本体工程 · Palantir 模式」
activate Tool #FFF3E0
Tool --> RT : 检索结果回执
deactivate Tool

RT -> Store : 更新参与者 status\nresearcher=waiting · tool=active
RT --> Researcher : 通知：工具回执已入账
deactivate RT

== ⑥ Event#5 · run_shell ==

Researcher -> RT : 协调意图：运行 shell 整理资料
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 run_shell
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-005-run-shell**
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-007**
Store --> RT : ok
deactivate RT

== ⑦ Event#6 · introduce_artifact（报告草稿） ==

Researcher -> RT : 协调意图：提交报告草稿
activate RT #E8F4FD

RT -> RT : admission 匹配 introduce_artifact
RT -> Log : 追加 **evt-006-introduce-doc**
note right of Log
  targets.primary=doc-draft-report
end note
Log --> RT : committed

RT -> Store : 应用变更 → **snap-008**
note right of Store
  + WorkArtifact doc-draft-report
  contentRef=ref:doc-body
  owner=agent-researcher
end note
Store --> RT : ok

RT --> Alice : 通知：调研报告草稿就绪
deactivate RT

note over Alice, Tool #F5F5F5
  **图例**
  实线 → 外部信号 / 协调意图 / 运行时写入
  虚线 ← 确认 / 通知 / 回执
  --
  ObservationEntry 只进 auditTail，不产生 Event
  CoordinationEvent 经 admission 后写入 ChangeLog 并应用快照
  initiator 是归因，不是触发器；Actor 不直接 emit Event
end note

@enduml
